/* 回看这次小行动（Figma 663:2446）：一张纸白卡——原计划米色块、两组分段、记录框、操作。 */
.action-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.action-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding: var(--p3-card);
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.action-plan {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

/* 原计划：与反馈信同一条青瓷竹节脊线 */
.action-spine {
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.action-spine__rail {
  display: flex;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6rpx;
  padding-top: 14rpx;
}

.action-spine__joint {
  width: 20rpx;
  height: 6rpx;
  border-radius: 3rpx;
  background: var(--p3-primary);
}

.action-spine__line {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  width: 4rpx;
  background: var(--p3-primary);
  opacity: 0.35;
}

.action-spine__copy {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1 0 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.action-spine__label {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.action-spine__body,
.action-stops__item {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.action-stops {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.action-field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.action-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.action-buttons__note {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
  text-align: center;
}
